<p>If you are choosing a Java application server and you like variety with optional stability then you have stumbled into the classic WildFly versus JBoss EAP debate. One is the community speed demon that ships new toys quickly. The other is the enterprise safe space with a subscription and human beings who will open tickets for you.</p>
